      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some more testing, it seems this canny post can be closed.\n\nThis behaviour seems to be the *intended* way for IK Execution Order to work. You can apparently turn your own solvers on/off by not including them in execution order, which will make them implicitly execute later on. You can also have a disabled execution order on another object containing VR IK and your own solver, and simply toggle between the two.",
